[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14040.349, "timestamp": "03:54:00", "text": "杀死那个隐形"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14042.87, "timestamp": "03:54:02", "text": "女人，事情就会顺利得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14045.55, "timestamp": "03:54:05", "text": "但是，我们最终还是赢了。 大家都表现得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14048.189, "timestamp": "03:54:08", "text": "很好。 在我看来，每个人都表现得很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14051.429, "timestamp": "03:54:11", "text": "。 这次徒步旅行非常成功。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14067.79, "timestamp": "03:54:27", "text": "我们拿到了白金1。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14085.429, "timestamp": "03:54:45", "text": "你知道吗？ 就因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14088.87, "timestamp": "03:54:48", "text": "打算避开这家伙，免得跟他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14092.11, "timestamp": "03:54:52", "text": "走散，因为他太菜了。 操"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14094.469, "timestamp": "03:54:54", "text": "我。 所以这些人当时在谈论"}]